    "title": "Messages",
    "description": "Messages is a free text messenger that allows you to exchange messages with any users with phone numbers, without needing to sign up for a separate messaging feature.\r\n\r\nEnjoy texting your family and friends conveniently using Messages.\r\n\r\n<b>Main features:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac Send instant text or <>group text in <b>group chat</b> conversations\r\n\ud83d\udcac End-to-end encryption by default message app\r\n\ud83d\udcac <b>Share location</b> and high-resolution photos\r\n\ud83d\udcac <b>Schedule messages</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcac <b>SMS backup and restore</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcac Block messages\r\n\ud83d\udcac Mark messages as read\r\n\ud83d\udcac Forward or delete multiple messages\r\n\ud83d\udcac Search for messages and contacts\r\n\ud83d\udcac Pin the top part of a chat room\r\n\ud83d\udcac Text messaging app supports multiple languages\r\n\r\nAndroid messages app provides users with an easy way to send and receive messages comfortably and safely. Messages interface is very intuitive and different messages are organized chronologically so that you can search and find any of them easily. Swipe across your screen to easily locate any of your SMS messages and tap to open them up for a quick read.\r\n\r\nWith this Messaging app, you can communicate with any of your contacts. Send unlimited texts, photos, contacts, and locations. Block certain unwanted contacts by tapping on them or marking notifications as already read.\r\n\r\n<b>With Messages, you can send more than just texts:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2714 Emojis\r\n\u2714 Contacts\r\n\u2714 Location\r\n\u2714 Photos\r\n\u2714 Schedule SMS Messenger\r\n\r\nMessenger app for text (SMS, MMS), you can stay in touch with your friends and family, and have fun conversations with them. You can send and receive SMS message through MMS and SMS app.\r\n\r\nTexting messages keeps your conversations safe and secure. Open messages and start a conversation using Messages Lite with one of your contacts. Messenger app provides a powerful text (SMS & MMS) function.\r\n\r\nJust select some contacts, compose your message, and send it, all in a matter of seconds! Enjoy the default SMS and MMS.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Messages is a free text messenger that allows you to exchange messages with any users with phone numbers, without needing to sign up for a separate messaging feature.<br><br>Enjoy texting your family and friends conveniently using Messages.<br><br><b>Main features:</b><br><br>\ud83d\udcac Send instant text or &lt;&gt;group text in <b>group chat</b> conversations<br>\ud83d\udcac End-to-end encryption by default message app<br>\ud83d\udcac <b>Share location</b> and high-resolution photos<br>\ud83d\udcac <b>Schedule messages</b><br>\ud83d\udcac <b>SMS backup and restore</b><br>\ud83d\udcac Block messages<br>\ud83d\udcac Mark messages as read<br>\ud83d\udcac Forward or delete multiple messages<br>\ud83d\udcac Search for messages and contacts<br>\ud83d\udcac Pin the top part of a chat room<br>\ud83d\udcac Text messaging app supports multiple languages<br><br>Android messages app provides users with an easy way to send and receive messages comfortably and safely. Messages interface is very intuitive and different messages are organized chronologically so that you can search and find any of them easily. Swipe across your screen to easily locate any of your SMS messages and tap to open them up for a quick read.<br><br>With this Messaging app, you can communicate with any of your contacts. Send unlimited texts, photos, contacts, and locations. Block certain unwanted contacts by tapping on them or marking notifications as already read.<br><br><b>With Messages, you can send more than just texts:</b><br><br>\u2714 Emojis<br>\u2714 Contacts<br>\u2714 Location<br>\u2714 Photos<br>\u2714 Schedule SMS Messenger<br><br>Messenger app for text (SMS, MMS), you can stay in touch with your friends and family, and have fun conversations with them. You can send and receive SMS message through MMS and SMS app.<br><br>Texting messages keeps your conversations safe and secure. Open messages and start a conversation using Messages Lite with one of your contacts. Messenger app provides a powerful text (SMS &amp; MMS) function.<br><br>Just select some contacts, compose your message, and send it, all in a matter of seconds! Enjoy the default SMS and MMS.",
